    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about being \"still\" though. it's like... the version of me that actually mattered, the one people cared about and the one that felt alive, she died when my career ended. everything after that is just a rerun. it feels like i'm just dragging around a corpse that's still breathing. does it even make sense to keep trying to find a \"new\" version when the real one is already gone?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
