      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is a heartbreaking feeling to feel like your life is a \"rerun\" when the pressure to succeed is the only weight you have to carry.\n\nThe \"you\" you are looking for did not die because of your failure to achieve a goal, but because life is permanent and that you can never feel \"alive\" all the time.\n\nPlease be gentle with yourself; your continued existence is already a miracle, and a safe place can help you heal the pain of that loss.",
